     "text": "99"
    },
    {
     "label": "B",
     "text": "250"
    },
    {
     "label": "C",
     "text": "349"
    },
    {
     "label": "D",
     "text": "201"
    }
   ],
   "answer": "A",
   "solution": "![A Smallest number when rounded to the nearest hundred is 300 = 250 Greatest number when rounded to the nearest hundred is 300 = 349 Difference between the smallest and greatest number = 349 – 250 = 99](asset:q5-sol)",
