   "stem": "![A cup can hold 200 ml of water. A flask can hold 4 cups of water while a pail can hold 5 flasks of water. How much water can a pail hold ? Give your answer in litres. A 40 ml B 4000 ml C 4 l D 40 l](asset:q12-full)",
