   "type": "mcq_single",
   "stem": "40 students and 2 teachers folded some paper cranes. The teachers folded twice as fast as the students. If each student folded 4 paper cranes, how many paper cranes did they fold altogether?",
   "options": [
    {
     "label": "A",
     "text": "168"
    },
    {
     "label": "B",
     "text": "176"
    },
    {
     "label": "C",
     "text": "192"
    },
    {
     "label": "D",
     "text": "224"
    }
   ],
   "answer": "B",
   "solution": "4 × 2 = 8\n\n2 × 8 = 16\n\nNo. of students = 40\n\nEach students folds 4 paper cranes = 40 × 4 = 160\n\nNo. of teachers = 2\n\nEach teacher folds paper cranes twice of a student = 4 × 2 = 8 → 2 × 8 = 16\n\nTotal paper = 160 + 16 = 176 cranes.",
   "topics": [
